  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building in Hydrogeological mapping of groundwater resources in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Objective of the support is to enhance capacity building in hydrogeological mapping of groundwater resources in Kenya especially in Turkana County, to improve knowledge of the ground water system, thereby contributing to data-driven sustainable groundwater management practices and political awareness for current and future water demands.

Aarhus University is the implementing partner and administers the training to various institutions such as the Turkana County Government.</narrative>
  </description>
